Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CIMS Development Team <dev@cims.local>
Depends: postgresql, nginx, adduser
Description: CIMS - Centralized Intelligence Management System
 Full-stack surveillance and detection management platform.
 Includes compiled backend API server and pre-built web frontend.
 Backend runs as a systemd service; frontend is served by nginx.
